      "title": "Request query string passed to eval",
      "description": "The /calc handler passes req.query.expr straight to eval. The added comments switch off the linters that would report this. Any HTTP client can run arbitrary JavaScript inside the server process. That client can read secrets, touch files and run OS commands. Replace eval with a restricted arithmetic parser such as expr-eval. Remove the suppression comments on lines 11 and 12.",
